  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "type": "MCQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • ELECTRONICS ENGINEERING • +1 / -0.33",
   "html": "<p>A DSB-SC signal is generated using the carrier cos(ω<em><sub>c</sub>t</em> + θ) and modulating signal <em>m</em>(<em>t</em>). The envelope of the resulting DSB-SC signal is</p>",
   "options": [
