  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "type": "NAT",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • ELECTRONICS ENGINEERING • +1 / -0",
   "html": "<p>An unmodulated AM transmitter power is given by 10 kW. When carrier is modulated by 1<sup>st </sup>message signal, AM power is increased to 15 kW. If carrier is simultaneously modulated by 2<sup>nd</sup> message signal with 50% of modulation, then resultant AM power will be _______ kW.</p>",
