  {
   "n": 8,
   "type": "NAT",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • ELECTRONICS ENGINEERING • +1 / -0",
   "html": "<p>The input given to an envelope detector of a singletone modulated signal is given by</p>\n\n<p><img align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" src=\"media/ba/baffd3d2240a2d0c653d.png\" /> The maximum value of time constant “<em>RC</em>” of the detector that can follow the envelope of the modulated signal is _________ μsec. (Rounded off to two decimal places)</p>",
